{"id":"64b63d5b2d39752e","group":"67","path":"67/67-lem-recursive-predicate-representability.md","title":"Numeralwise Representation of Recursive Predicates in Q","display":"lem-recursive-predicate-representability — Numeralwise Representation of Recursive Predicates in Q","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-lem-recursive-predicate-representability","aliases":["67-lem-recursive-predicate-representability"],"display":"lem-recursive-predicate-representability — Numeralwise Representation of Recursive Predicates in Q","depends_on":["[[67-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[67-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[67-df-formula]]","[[67-df-prim-provability]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-lem-recursive-predicate-representability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-lem-recursive-predicate-representability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-recursive-predicate-representability — Numeralwise Representation of Recursive Predicates in Q"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5f966a5415552b4e\" href=\"?note=5f966a5415552b4e\" title=\"67-df-recursive-function-class\">67-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"824fdc45d800b7dd\" href=\"?note=824fdc45d800b7dd\" title=\"67-df-robinson-arithmetic\">67-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_k\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_k\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5f966a5415552b4e\" href=\"?note=5f966a5415552b4e\" title=\"67-df-recursive-function-class\">67-df-recursive-function-class</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\rangle\">\\(\\vec x=\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>、数词、同时无捕获代入和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 使用本册接口。这里只主张每个标准数元组的双表示；不把逐数结论提升为 Q 中统一的全函数性或真假判定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[\\vec x]\\ \\forall\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N^k\\\n\\left[(\\vec m\\in A\\Longrightarrow Q\\vdash\\alpha[\\bar{\\vec m}/\\vec x])\\land\n(\\vec m\\notin A\\Longrightarrow Q\\vdash\\neg\\alpha[\\bar{\\vec m}/\\vec x])\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[\\vec x]\\ \\forall\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N^k\\\n\\left[(\\vec m\\in A\\Longrightarrow Q\\vdash\\alpha[\\bar{\\vec m}/\\vec x])\\land\n(\\vec m\\notin A\\Longrightarrow Q\\vdash\\neg\\alpha[\\bar{\\vec m}/\\vec x])\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐原 Q 本质不可判定性证明所依赖而未给出文本的递归关系逐数双表示事实。该定理不主张所有递归函数都在 PA 或 Q 中可证全。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"5f966a5415552b4e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"824fdc45d800b7dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"5f966a5415552b4e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\ge1$，$A\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_k$，见 [[67-df-recursive-function-class]]；$\\vec x=\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\rangle$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[\\vec x]\\ \\forall\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N^k\\\n\\left[(\\vec m\\in A\\Longrightarrow Q\\vdash\\alpha[\\bar{\\vec m}/\\vec x])\\land\n(\\vec m\\notin A\\Longrightarrow Q\\vdash\\neg\\alpha[\\bar{\\vec m}/\\vec x])\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1506,"backlinks":[{"id":"438750d9f2566c57","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的编号与 [[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]] 的固定点接口；递归集合在 Q 中逐数双表示取 [[67-lem-recursive-predicate-representability]]。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-lem-recursive-predicate-representability]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-lem-recursive-predicate-representability]]"}],"outgoing":["5f966a5415552b4e","824fdc45d800b7dd","2035a1f4d72e7df9","573b4c635ea6d91f"]}